text = "You fell asleep studying and got locked in the library overnight. Your exam is tomorrow morning!

Find all 5 books hidden around the library, then bring them back to the front desk to get out.

Move with WASD or the arrow keys.

Ghosts float through the walls. If one sees you it will follow you, so keep moving. If a ghost touches you, it's over."
